WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.293 --> 00:00:03.878
Abnormalities in nerve circuits!

00:00:04.337 --> 00:00:06.631
There are two foreign bodies
in the entry plug.

00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:09.009
There's noise mixed in
with the nerve pulses.

00:00:16.224 --> 00:00:17.475
Now! Retreat!

00:00:21.688 --> 00:00:26.151
-Use recovery route 34. Pull back to...
-Hey, newbie! She said to retreat!

00:00:26.234 --> 00:00:28.361
-Don't run away. Don't run away.
-Newbie!

00:00:29.195 --> 00:00:30.071
Don't run away!

00:00:31.072 --> 00:00:32.532
Progressive Knife equipped!

00:00:36.494 --> 00:00:39.330
Shinji, obey my order! I said to retreat!

00:00:39.831 --> 00:00:40.832
Shinji!

00:00:45.837 --> 00:00:46.671
That idiot!

00:01:05.565 --> 00:01:08.526
Unit 01 active time remaining, 30 seconds!

00:01:09.027 --> 00:01:09.861
Twenty-eight!

00:01:10.236 --> 00:01:12.363
Twenty-seven! Twenty-six!

00:01:12.697 --> 00:01:13.698
Twenty-five!

00:01:18.369 --> 00:01:19.871
Fourteen! Thirteen!

00:01:20.413 --> 00:01:21.873
Twelve! Eleven!

00:01:22.165 --> 00:01:23.583
Ten! Nine!

00:01:24.084 --> 00:01:25.376
Eight! Seven!

00:01:25.919 --> 00:01:27.378
Six! Five!

00:01:27.629 --> 00:01:29.130
Four! Three!

00:01:29.422 --> 00:01:30.882
Two! One!

00:01:38.723 --> 00:01:40.642
Eva-01 has ceased operation.

00:01:40.809 --> 00:01:42.936
Target is completely inactive.

